      <h2 class="section-title" id="intro-title">What is facade signage?</h2>
      <p>Facade signage is the most visible signage element a business operates: the storefront name and logo seen from the street, the illuminated sign that draws traffic after dark, the architectural lettering on a corporate office. It is also the most regulated. In Rotterdam, most facade signage above modest size thresholds requires an Omgevingsvergunning (environmental permit) from the municipality, with technical drawings, structural calculations and welstandscommissie aesthetic review for high-profile locations.</p>

      <p>We deliver the full chain in-house. Design and digital mockup within 48 hours. Permit documentation prepared and submitted on your behalf. Production at our Rotterdam print and fabrication partners. Installation by the owner, including rope-access or scissor-lift work where the height demands it. After installation, two years of warranty on materials and structural attachment, five years on LED components.</p>

      <h3 style="margin-top:var(--space-6);">Five common formats</h3>
      <ul style="list-style:disc; padding-left:var(--space-5); color:var(--ink-muted); line-height:var(--lh-base); margin-top:var(--space-3);">
        <li style="margin-bottom:var(--space-3);"><strong style="color:var(--ink);">Printed boards (aluminium-composite or acrylic)</strong> &mdash; the most cost-effective format. UV-laminated vinyl on rigid panel, mounted flush or stood off the facade.</li>
        <li style="margin-bottom:var(--space-3);"><strong style="color:var(--ink);">Banners and mesh</strong> &mdash; PVC or mesh banners for short-term campaigns, seasonal promotions and construction-site hoarding.</li>
        <li style="margin-bottom:var(--space-3);"><strong style="color:var(--ink);">Dimensional letters (CNC-milled or built-up)</strong> &mdash; 3D letters in aluminium, acrylic or composite. Non-illuminated or paired with halo lighting.</li>
        <li style="margin-bottom:var(--space-3);"><strong style="color:var(--ink);">Illuminated light boxes</strong> &mdash; enclosed boxes with translucent face and internal LED. Reliable, low maintenance, suitable for hospitality and retail.</li>
        <li><strong style="color:var(--ink);">Channel letters</strong> &mdash; individually constructed 3D letters with internal LED. Front-lit, halo-lit or combination. The premium option for retail, hotels and corporate offices.</li>
